      "Repeated handoff without retaining cached images could hit an existing purged-image assertion in both variants; those attempts are not comparable handoff measurements.",
      "Large elapsed-time variation prompted fresh baseline/final runs with both CPU and elapsed clocks. Earlier wall-only launches are not used in this final comparison."
    ],
    "limits": "Simulator measurements with warm caches and the recorded workloads. Two launches per variant do not prove strict zero overhead on every device; small changes must be compared with control and launch variation."
